{"step_index":661,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-20T17:55:37Z","thinking":"**Analyzing the Structure**\n\nOkay, I'm digging into the current structure to understand how to best integrate the \"Phương án 1\" segmented control for the \"Hiện trạng\" and \"Lộ trình\" pages. Specifically, I'm reviewing `src/app/(portal)/layout.tsx` to get a handle on the existing framework. I'm focusing on the best way to introduce this feature.\n\n\n**Refining the Approach**\n\nI've been evaluating different strategies. Either merge the pages into a single route and utilize state to manage the view, or maintain separate routes but incorporate the `<Segmented>` control within `layout.tsx` to handle navigation. Although merging appears appealing, I'm leaning towards separate routes with a unified layout because the code is already intricate.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"view_file","args":{"AbsolutePath":"C:\\Delta Force\\kts-vinhlong\\src\\app\\(portal)\\layout.tsx","toolAction":"Viewing Portal Layout to replace the nav bar with a Segmented control","toolSummary":"View Portal Layout"}}]}
